      "name": "[Blueprint][Jane] Encircle and Hunt - Lv. 60",
      "desc": "This blueprint can be used to unlock the crafting of Jane's exclusive Tactical Prism at the Smart Workshop. Purchase them from Boojee's Store - Season Limited.\nItem Effect: When Etheric Phantom is used, Jane immediately recovers 100 points of Passion Stream.\n{AWAKEN_1261#<color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Aerial Sweep</color> will be enhanced to <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Aerial Sweep - Onslaught</color>, greatly increasing its DMG Multiplier and Anomaly Buildup.} {NOAWAKEN_1261#<color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Aerial Sweep</color> will be enhanced to <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Aerial Sweep - Onslaught</color>}. When this skill hits an enemy, it inflicts <color=#FFFFFF>Wound</color>. This state causes the affected target to take <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color> equal to 60% of Jane's ATK every second and accumulate <color=#F0D12B>Physical Anomaly Buildup</color>, lasting 8s. Repeated triggers reset the duration.",
